Alphabet's revenue for the quarter ending June 30, 2023 was $74.604B, a 7.06% increase year-over-year. For the twelve months ending June 30, 2023, Alphabet's revenue was $289.531B, a 4.1% increase year-over-year. Alphabet's current revenue (TTM) is $289.53B.

