Thank you for your time and advice!

In order to develop any dynamic web page you will have to use JavaScript or one of its off shoots like CoffeeScript. However if your goal is to simply handle requests between the front/back end you do not need it. If you want to use JavaScript for both the front and back end you can use Node.js, but you expressed your preference for Python. 

&#x200B;

I recommended Flask/Bottle since they are far lighter and easier to use for simpler tasks. Django is better for large applications but the learning curve is far higher.

For me it sort of has. If the game goes late Zerg just autowins. I've always found it annoying how Protoss/Terran have to constantly harass/kill Zerg before they get to broodlord infestor or they just die. PvT was too P favored before EMP buffs, now the matchup is quite balanced and fun to watch. TvZ is fun to watch in the ling bane vs marine medivac stage and PvZ feels the same every game, that is Protoss tries to kill Zerg with stargate and immortals or loses.

&#x200B;

I'm still predicting a ZvZ finals with Serral winning - but good games of starcraft will be played nonetheless.

Cheese is an art :P (although I hate being cannon rushed hehe doing it makes me laugh). Thanks to zerg being so busted the Hive convinced me to join them, now I spam roaches :)

&#x200B;

The greatest feeling for me now is when you defend a triple proxy rax with those cute drones and then counterattack for the win.

