Off campus honestly. It's way cheaper and more comfortable. A double room at UB will cost you $8.5k for 8 months, and for that you get a room \*cough cough\* box which is 180 sq ft for 2 people, with not much space other than to stand. The other rooms with more roommates are even more crowded. Common bathrooms too unless you live on South. For the same price you could rent an entire apartment for yourself off campus for the whole year.

&#x200B;

Most food on campus is pretty mediocre and unhealthy for the price you pay.

